  "description": "Unleash raw urban grit, grunge attitude, and expressive artistic energy with AURORA LOTUS! Masterfully crafted as an edgy street-art display font, each character features bold hand-painted brush strokes and dramatic liquid drips oozing from the letterforms.\nEssential for grunge band posters, streetwear apparel branding, skate deck graphics, album covers, urban graffiti art, sticker packs, and custom Cricut or Silhouette vinyl craft projects, AURORA LOTUS makes every word drip with fearless style!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Unleash raw urban grit, grunge attitude, and expressive artistic energy with AURORA LOTUS! Masterfully crafted as an edgy street-art display font, each character features bold hand-painted brush strokes and dramatic liquid drips oozing from the letterforms.</p>\n<p>Essential for grunge band posters, streetwear apparel branding, skate deck graphics, album covers, urban graffiti art, sticker packs, and custom Cricut or Silhouette vinyl craft projects, AURORA LOTUS makes every word drip with fearless style!</p>",
